  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Growth Gateway - Supporting Resource Surveying Capability for Critical Minerals FY25/26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The British Geological Survey (BGS) is a non-departmental public body, part of UK Research and Innovation (UKRI) through the Natural Environment Research Council (NERC). This work focusses on providing expert advice on geological data acquisition, management and interpretation as well as bespoke support to partner country Geological Surveys, and their associated ministries to support governments develop mining codes and better understand their mineral reserves.</narrative>
  </description>
